  first | exact @GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.SW.Pack.box_packing | exact GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.SW.Pack.box_packing | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.SW.Pack.box_packing <;> assumption)
